    "section": "24. Core Abilities",
    "ruleNumber": "24.26",
    "summary": "**[ONE SHOT]**. Track the battle-long use limit separately for every copy. A model carrying two identical weapons can fire each once. If the bearer is destroyed and brought back to its unit, a spent weapon stays spent. Each such weapon in a unit newly added to the army comes with one use.",
